{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/874c98b91fe2ff59ca9f900bc4494ab8.webp?t=1767144407\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend through the twisted levels of the Backrooms using <strong>physics-based object manipulation</strong> to overcome obstacles, <strong>solve mind-bending puzzles</strong>, and <strong>uncover unsettling secrets</strong>. Play solo or team up in <strong>online co-op with up to 4 players</strong> as you climb higher, think smarter, and survive the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/0683025f1e4dff86b8e7f5f3eb83ea77.poster.avif?t=1767144407\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/0683025f1e4dff86b8e7f5f3eb83ea77.webm?t=1767144407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/0683025f1e4dff86b8e7f5f3eb83ea77.mp4?t=1767144407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/2bc2a7d3d96b2dbc85f06eaf08b1ef12.webp?t=1767144407\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team up with up to 3 others in online co-op!</strong> Work together to <strong>solve puzzles, move objects, and survive the horrors</strong> that lurk in the shadows. Or go solo for a truly intense experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/6e18d3f4b473365e5e5d3ab893842308.poster.avif?t=1767144407\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/6e18d3f4b473365e5e5d3ab893842308.webm?t=1767144407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/6e18d3f4b473365e5e5d3ab893842308.mp4?t=1767144407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/53c98a40c93cc03b43929b3b23be6ee6.webp?t=1767144407\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your mind to overcome more than just physical obstacles. <strong>Decrypt riddles, unlock paths, and outsmart the strange logic of the backrooms</strong> to continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/6cf4ec0981b94f4e13bbd1c560bb737a.webp?t=1767144407\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You're not alone.</i></strong> Watch your back as you encounter lurking threats in the dark. Outsmart them, outrun them, or find a way to fight\u2014but remember: they\u2019re always watching.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Your First Climb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3575300/ceaeb0a663bc42d1947cffae903d3a65de5595dd.jpg"},{"name":"Level 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3575300/5f521c1e72192956507aee79db985e40ff04278c.jpg"},{"name":"Level 20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3575300/6364dfe14841d71971b3b04828362207d20a8884.jpg"},{"name":"Level 30","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3575300/5ad5b084f46c176e0550130c385392f5752bbb0c.jpg"},{"name":"Level 40","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3575300/e783f5e570dbdcac85935f45cad53078046e123f.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575300?t=1767144407","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/214ebdf05ed16975eba6fd0da8debcdf0ca44852/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767144407","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/9c18114b66a2d6325727322ac1a657a8332cdf91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767144407","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/9c18114b66a2d6325727322ac1a657a8332cdf91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767144407","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains intense horror elements, including frequent jump scares, graphic depictions of blood and gore, and disturbing imagery. Players may encounter unsettling environments, violent deaths, and scenes involving dismemberment or mutilation. There are themes of psychological horror that may be distressing to some, including feelings of helplessness and fear of being hunted.\r\n\r\nThere are no depictions of sexual acts, sexual assault, or non-consensual sex. The game does not include drug or alcohol abuse, nor does it depict self-harm or suicide. However, due to the graphic violence and horror themes, the game is not recommended for players sensitive to gore or intense horror experiences."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/874c98b91fe2ff59ca9f900bc4494ab8.webp?t=1767144407\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend through the twisted levels of the Backrooms using <strong>physics-based object manipulation</strong> to overcome obstacles, <strong>solve mind-bending puzzles</strong>, and <strong>uncover unsettling secrets</strong>. Play solo or team up in <strong>online co-op with up to 4 players</strong> as you climb higher, think smarter, and survive the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/0683025f1e4dff86b8e7f5f3eb83ea77.poster.avif?t=1767144407\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/0683025f1e4dff86b8e7f5f3eb83ea77.webm?t=1767144407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/0683025f1e4dff86b8e7f5f3eb83ea77.mp4?t=1767144407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/2bc2a7d3d96b2dbc85f06eaf08b1ef12.webp?t=1767144407\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team up with up to 3 others in online co-op!</strong> Work together to <strong>solve puzzles, move objects, and survive the horrors</strong> that lurk in the shadows. Or go solo for a truly intense experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >